cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Skeletal Action-Quality Attribution: reference-free calibrated quality regression with validated per-joint, per-phase attribution"
abstract: >-
  A reference-free action-quality assessment pipeline built on a hand-rolled
  spatio-temporal graph convolution, an ordinal scoring head, non-crossing
  quantile intervals, and per-joint / per-phase attribution that is validated
  against exact ground truth from a procedural motion generator.
authors:
